        "сирий": "{\"version\":\"1\",\"text\":\"I built this look for your working day: mild autumn weather, no rain, and about a 20-minute walk. The cream cotton shirt, black trousers and leather loafers form a calm base that suits an office. The linen coat on top is rated for mild, warm and hot weather, so it fits a mild autumn day, but I have no warmth data for it. If the morning feels cool, it may not be enough on its own. The beige bag, braided belt and silver earrings finish it quietly. I treated your 154 cm height as a plain fact and did not apply any proportion rule.\",\"how_to_wear\":[\"Wear the cream shirt tucked or loose under the linen coat, with the black trousers and loafers.\",\"Wear the coat open or belted with its own tie, and raise its collar. That puts a vertical line near your face and sharpens the silhouette.\",\"Add the braided belt and the earrings last, so the outfit stays simple.\"],\"wrong_photos\":[\"#562·06: the photo shows navy loafers, but the catalogue lists this pair as black.\"],\"named\":[],\"about_items\":[{\"n\":\"#2987·01\",\"text\":\"A cream cotton shirt with a light, fitted cut. Its formality range of 4 to 6 suits a work day, and the soft light colour sits well against the black trousers.\"},{\"n\":\"#508·02\",\"text\":\"Black trousers with a formality range of 3 to 7, a dependable base for the office. I have no data on their fabric or cut, so I make no claims about either.\"},{\"n\":\"#1754·05\",\"text\":\"A beige linen coat. Linen is rated for mild, warm and hot weather, which matches your mild, dry day. It is the outer layer and has a formality range of 5 to 8. The catalogue lists it at knee length. I did not judge where the hem falls on you.\"},{\"n\":\"#562·06\",\"text\":\"Leather loafers with a leather sole and a formality range of 4 to 6, right for work. I have no heel or tread data, so I cannot say how they will feel over the 20-minute walk.\"},{\"n\":\"#152·07\",\"text\":\"A beige leather bag in a soft, neutral tone that sits calmly with the cream shirt and the beige coat.\"},{\"n\":\"#102·08\",\"text\":\"A braided leather belt that adds some texture to an otherwise smooth outfit.\"},{\"n\":\"#21·12\",\"text\":\"Small silver earrings. They add a light accent near your face without competing with the collar.\"}]}",
